{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["YuruYuri Season 2","The girls of the Amusement Club return in Yuru Yuri♪♪, finding new ways to make passing time even more enjoyable. Their members consist of the always energetic Kyouko Toshinou; calm and sensible Yui Funami; polite but often overlooked Akari Akaza; and Chinatsu Yoshikawa, who stumbled upon the others while looking for the Tea Ceremony Club. Together they are the Amusement Club, which has the deceptively simple task of keeping its members entertained.\n\n\n\nAlong with the Student Council and the odd family member, they strive to enjoy their youth to the fullest. Whether it's a trip to a hot spring or finishing overdue homework, their lives are never dull, and they will always find an excuse to spend time together.\n\n\n\n(Source: MAL Rewrite)"],"ja":["ゆるゆり♪♪",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[{"id":10495,"relation":"prequel"},{"id":23225,"relation":"sequel"}],"id":"mal-12403","ids":{"shikimori":12403,"mal":12403,"anilist":12403,"kodik":"serial-8206"},"kodikIds":["serial-8207","serial-8206"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-8207":"2019-12-13T23:25:40Z","serial-8206":"2018-01-02T05:23:35Z"},"title":"Лилии на ветру 2","originalTitle":"Yuru Yuri","alt":"Юру Юри / Cвободу Лесбиянкам YuruYuri Season 2 ゆるゆり♪♪","description":"Второй сезон Yuru Yuri . Нас снова ждёт самая обычная школьница Акари , спокойная Юи , взбалмошная и шумная Кёко и розоволосая красавица Чинацу . Снова девочки будут валять дурака в своём кружке, приглашать туда своих не менее шумных и странных друзей и весело проводить время, борясь с рутиной школьных дней. В общем делать так, чтобы скучно не было никому!","year":2012,"type":"TV","genres":["Комедия","седзе ай","юри","cgdct","гэг юмор","Школа"],"rating":7.81,"popularity":47309,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[10495,23225],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/media/anime/cover/large/bx12403-sAG2FsLFX8bH.jpg","width":460,"height":648},"backdrop":{"url":"https://s4